      "text": "\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:50338:50340"
    },
    {
      "id": "214:p2",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你用手指堵住耳朵，用手肘顶了一下停止键。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:50340:50362"
    },
    {
      "id": "214:p3",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "小屋又安静下来。电视静静地坐在那里发着光。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:50362:50385"
    },
    {
      "id": "214:p4",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "你把手了拿下来，心脏还在胸腔里狂跳。他的话。他是怎么知道这些名字的？他是怎么知道你的？\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:50385:50430"
    },
    {
      "id": "214:p5",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "回到 186。\r\n",
      "sourceLocation": "txt:chars:50430:50439"
    }
  ]
}
